Privacy Policy for Carnatic Shruthi Box Studio

Shruthi Box is a Carnatic music learning app that provides Tanpura, Tala, Raga, and Arohana features.

The app uses Google Play Billing to manage optional paid subscriptions.

We do not sell personal data.

We do not request access to contacts, photos, location, microphone recordings, messages, or device files for advertising or tracking.

If the app stores basic preferences locally on the device, they remain on the device and are used only to improve app behavior and subscription state.

Subscription purchases are processed by Google Play, and payment details are handled by Google according to Google Play's own policies.

This app may collect or process only the minimum data necessary to operate the app, support purchases, and improve basic functionality.

If you contact us for support, any information you provide will be used only to respond to your request.

For questions, contact: subsumgames@gmail.com
